            <ArticleTitle>Chronic musculoskeletal pain in a pediatric patient: case report from the United Kingdom, with commentaries from Spain and Israel.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>391-2; discussion 392-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3109/15360288.2012.734910</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of a 12-year-old female with complex regional pain syndrome (CRPS) is presented. Difficulties making the diagnosis are described. The importance of using an interdisciplinary approach that includes appropriate pharmacotherapy are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
